          \  \nEnvironmental Protection Agency. (2025). *Water Workforce Retirement Projections 2025–2035.* [epa.gov](https://www.epa.gov/waterworkforce)\
          \  \nGlocert International. (2026). *ISO 27001 Implementation Roadmap: 30-60-90 Day Plan.* [glocertinternational.com](https://www.glocertinternational.com/resources/guides/iso-27001-implementation-roadmap/)\
          \  \nNuHarbor Security. (2025). *EPA Cybersecurity for Water Systems: What to Expect (2025–2026).* [nuharborsecurity.com](https://www.nuharborsecurity.com/blog/epa-cybersecurity-for-water-systems-what-to-expect-2025-2026)\
          \  \nScrut Automation. (2024). *How long does ISO 27001 certification take?* [scrut.io](https://www.scrut.io/hub/iso-27001/iso-27001-timeline)\
          \  \nTexas Commission on Environmental Quality. (2025). *Agreed Order Docket No. 2019-0085-MWD-E (Austin Water).*\
